  "rhythm": "Twitch owner credit: Acry. Revised after preview feedback: the ocarina now follows the fast recurring keyboard/bass riff visually transcribed from the blue left-hand notes in GovzLegacy's piano roll at 18.23-38.23, rather than stretching the sparse upper voice across its rests. Every half-beat, one-beat and dotted-beat onset comes from that source; octave registration was folded into C4-Bb4 before the builder moved the full arrangement up 6 semitones. The tutorial and original-track chord analysis both mark about 150 BPM, so the speed comes from the real eighth-note activity rather than an unsupported 300 BPM setting. Harmony follows the source Fm-Db-Eb-Bbm-Db-Eb cycle with the same +6 shift. The source has no separate drum transcription, so a custom eighth-note electronic backbone supplies the repository fallback. Faulconer's album page confirms the official cue.",
